meta {
  name: 10 Schedules
  seq: 11
}

docs {
  `/api/schedules`: the preview of a rule, the checks on a new schedule, and user B
  (`otherToken`) getting `404` for user A's project in bodies and queries. A schedule needs an
  enabled model, and Bruno has no model provider, so the route tests on Postgres create
  schedules and check user B's `404` for their ids in paths.
}
